sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as Agent
  participant M as Model
  participant T as Tools

  A->>M: messages plus tool schemas
  M-->>A: AIMessage with TWO tool_calls
  Note over A,T: two calls in one response, so run them concurrently
  par
    A->>T: get_order(id=123)
    T-->>A: ToolMessage
  and
    A->>T: check_stock(sku=A1)
    T-->>A: ToolMessage
  end
  A->>M: messages plus BOTH ToolMessages
  M-->>A: AIMessage with an answer and no tool_calls
  Note over A: no tool_calls, so the loop ends
